00:20:24,040 --> 00:20:25,840
require far more rigorous study.

561
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,040
First aid Meribaj

562
00:20:27,040 --> 00:20:28,879
and life-saving Meribaj are valuable

563
00:20:28,879 --> 00:20:30,440
and they're a valuable set of skills,

564
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:32,879
But we would never depend on them

565
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:35,280
as a sole indication

566
00:20:35,280 --> 00:20:37,040
of somebody's skill level,

567
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:38,920
maturity and their ability

568
00:20:38,920 --> 00:20:40,440
to handle a situation

569
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:41,800
that a lifeguard or an EMT

570
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:42,879
would handle, would we?

571
00:20:42,879 --> 00:20:44,160
Now I am going to differ

572
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,720
with the others

573
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:48,280
that say in today's busy schedules

574
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:50,040
it's too hard to find a Meribaj counselor

575
00:20:50,040 --> 00:20:50,880
in schedule meetings

576
00:20:50,880 --> 00:20:51,520
and things like that.

577
00:20:51,520 --> 00:20:52,800
Well, we have things like email.

578
00:20:53,240 --> 00:20:55,400
I have done significant parts

579
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:57,120
of Meribaj's that I counsel

580
00:20:57,120 --> 00:20:57,920
with email.

581
00:20:58,600 --> 00:20:59,960
My inner drill sergeant

582
00:20:59,960 --> 00:21:02,480
would like to see more rigor

583
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,440
in study

584
00:21:03,440 --> 00:21:04,760
and more rigor

585
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:06,440
in the instruction of Meribaj's.

586
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:08,800
but understanding what Meribaj's represent,

587
00:21:08,800 --> 00:21:10,160
what they're supposed to represent

588
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:11,760
and how scouts

589
00:21:11,760 --> 00:21:13,200
will have learned a little something

590
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:15,520
about a given field of study

591
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:16,160
or endeavor.

592
00:21:16,640 --> 00:21:17,840
I'm quite satisfied

593
00:21:17,840 --> 00:21:19,520
with the way that the system works.

594
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,480
I will have a little internal dialogue

595
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,800
with the internal drill sergeant

596
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:23,960
and I will say: you know,

597
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:26,400
it's not that big a deal.

598
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:28,880
Baden Powell said something

599
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:30,640
about the jollity of scouting.

600
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:32,280
Jollity is not a word

601
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:33,320
that you hear a whole lot,

602
00:21:33,320 --> 00:21:33,960
but you know

603
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,680
Baden Powell was born in 1857,

604
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:37,640
so let's cut him a break.

605
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:39,280
That indicates to me

606
00:21:39,600 --> 00:21:41,680
a certain amount of lightness

607
00:21:41,720 --> 00:21:43,080
and fun

608
00:21:43,480 --> 00:21:45,480
and intensity and excitement

609
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:47,080
surrounding the work of scouting.

610
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,560
I wouldn't be too upset

611
00:21:48,560 --> 00:21:49,560
about the Meribaj days.

612
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:50,240
I kind of agree.

613
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,120
I'm a little suspicious

614
00:21:51,120 --> 00:21:51,640
of the whole thing.

615
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:53,360
I'm suspicious of, you know,

616
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:55,640
30 guys and a 16-year-old counselor

617
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,760
trying to complete swimming

618
00:21:56,760 --> 00:21:57,720
Meribaj at camp.

619
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:59,760
Just how rigorous and complete

620
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:00,880
can the instruction be

621
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:02,320
in that kind of a situation?

622
00:22:02,720 --> 00:22:04,160
But it's been going on for years

623
00:22:04,160 --> 00:22:05,560
and you know I'm satisfied

624
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:07,000
that the guys have gotten out of it

625
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,120
what they need to get out of it.

626
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:10,080
These are not my badges to protect.

627
00:22:10,280 --> 00:22:12,080
They're not my standards to protect.

628
00:22:12,480 --> 00:22:13,960
I have yet to embroider

629
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,280
hand, embroider a Meribaj

630
00:22:15,280 --> 00:22:16,679
and hand it out at a court of honor.

631
00:22:17,120 --> 00:22:18,320
We go and buy them

632
00:22:18,320 --> 00:22:20,320
from the Boy Scouts of America

633
00:22:20,320 --> 00:22:21,480
who own the Meribaj

634
00:22:21,879 --> 00:22:23,399
and who own the program,

635
00:22:23,919 --> 00:22:25,439
And I will

636
00:22:25,960 --> 00:22:27,240
assent to the way

637
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:28,480
that they're going to administer it,

638
00:22:28,480 --> 00:22:29,760
even though, even though

639
00:22:29,760 --> 00:22:30,679
the inter-drill sergeant,

640
00:22:30,679 --> 00:22:32,040
may have some difficulties with it.

641
